  "id": "TC-30",
  "name": "烧蚀防热材料热分析",
  "nameEn": "Ablation Heat Shield Thermal Analysis - Carbon/Phenolic Composite",
  "description": "碳/酚醛烧蚀防热材料再入热环境分析。再入热流密度q=5×10⁶W/m²，表面温度T_surface≈3000K。材料物性：密度ρ=1440kg/m³，比热c_p=1260J/(kg·K)，热导率k=1.0W/(m·K)，烧蚀潜热h_ab=1.5×10⁶J/kg。烧蚀率计算：ṁ=q/(c_p·ΔT+h_ab)=5e6/(1260×2700+1.5e6)=5e6/(3.402e6+1.5e6)=5e6/4.902e6=1.02kg/(m²·s)。线烧蚀率v_abl=ṁ/ρ=1.02/1440=7.08×10⁻⁴m/s=0.708mm/s。考虑辐射散热q_rad=ε·σ·T⁴=0.85×5.67e-8×3000⁴=3.91×10⁶W/m²，净热流q_net=q-q_rad=1.09×10⁶W/m²，修正烧蚀率v_abl≈0.15mm/s。瞬态耦合分析烧蚀退行与温度场演化。",
  "category": "thermal",
  "usage": "research",
  "difficulty": 5,
  "tags": ["ablation", "heat_shield", "carbon_phenolic", "reentry", "recession_rate", "thermal_protection", "radiation_cooling", "hypersonic"],
